575
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,040
Come here and give me a hand.

576
00:28:11,040 --> 00:28:12,360
I pulled my groin, bro.

577
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:13,520
I can't walk.

578
00:28:13,520 --> 00:28:14,400
You're totally useless.

579
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,640
Hanging out with you, seriously...

580
00:28:16,320 --> 00:28:17,000
Let's go, let's go.

581
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,480
Easy, easy.

582
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:22,560
Is it in here?

583
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:24,280
Okay.

584
00:28:31,360 --> 00:28:32,160
Yangyang!

585
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,200
Mom!

586
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:34,960
You disappeared the second I looked away.

587
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:35,680
Give me your hand.

588
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:37,280
Didn't I tell you?

589
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:38,440
Don't run off by yourself.

590
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:39,520
You scared me to death!

591
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:39,920
Mom.

592
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:40,600
What is it?

593
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:42,840
Someone picked on Yangyang and Yaya.

594
00:28:45,520 --> 00:28:46,640
What are you doing?

595
00:28:46,760 --> 00:28:48,000
Why are you picking on him?

596
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:49,480
It...

597
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:51,720
This man saved me.

598
00:28:54,600 --> 00:28:55,440
I'm sorry.

599
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:56,120
I'm so sorry. I'm sorry.

600
00:28:56,120 --> 00:28:56,640
It's fine.

601
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,480
I'm a good guy.

602
00:28:58,640 --> 00:28:59,720
Who picked on you?

603
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,000
Yangyang is fine.

604
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:04,080
Don't be mad, Mom.

605
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:06,480
Thank you.

606
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:07,720
Thank you for saving Yangyang.

607
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:08,640
You're welcome.

608
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:09,520
It was nothing.

609
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:10,200
I'd like...

610
00:29:10,200 --> 00:29:11,360
I'd like to ask...

611
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:14,080
this place in Chunguang Alley...

612
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:17,360
How do I get to Lijuan Barbershop?

613
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:20,640
Who are you?

614
00:29:22,600 --> 00:29:23,400
Sit down.

615
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,320
Um, you...

616
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:25,680
"You" what?

617
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:26,840
Listen to me.

618
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:27,720
"Me" what?

619
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:29,120
What's with this and that?

620
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:29,600
Watch me.

621
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:30,080
I...

622
00:29:32,360 --> 00:29:33,320
Spit it out!

623
00:29:59,160 --> 00:29:59,960
What do you think?

624
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:02,240
Feel like a new man?

625
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,120
You look handsome.

626
00:30:04,520 --> 00:30:05,400
Does it look good?

627
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:06,720
It looks good.

628
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:09,880
Really good.

629
00:30:12,080 --> 00:30:13,640
But I didn't come for a haircut.

630
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:19,440
You didn't come for a haircut?

631
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:20,800
Then what are you here for?

632
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:22,640
Yiran told me to come.

633
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:24,840
To learn the trade from you.

634
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,520
That mother and daughter duo,

635
00:30:30,520 --> 00:30:32,760
always making trouble for me all day.

636
00:30:32,760 --> 00:30:34,480
Like a couple of debt collectors.

637
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,720
Let me tell you, Ah Min,

638
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,280
if it weren't for the fact

639
00:30:39,280 --> 00:30:40,920
that you helped Yangyang,

640
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,840
I wouldn't teach you for free.

641
00:30:42,840 --> 00:30:43,560
You know?

642
00:30:46,040 --> 00:30:47,080
Did you hear me?

643
00:30:47,680 --> 00:30:47,960
G-

644
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:48,760
Got it, got it.

645
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:49,880
Come over here.

646
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:50,760
Okay.

647
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:56,600
Stand here.

648
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:01,320
Watch closely.

649
00:31:01,320 --> 00:31:02,400
In a minute,

650
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,800
follow what I teach you

651
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:07,080
and try it yourself.

652
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:10,120
Just treat this fur as human hair.

653
00:31:10,120 --> 00:31:11,040
See that?

654
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,720
After you comb it smooth,

655
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,480
with this hand,

656
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:16,400
just snip.

657
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,760
Snip.

658
00:31:17,760 --> 00:31:18,480
See?

659
00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:20,840
Just don't cut your hand.

660
00:31:21,240 --> 00:31:22,000
Got it?

661
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:22,720
Got it.

662
00:31:23,120 --> 00:31:23,880
Yangyang!

663
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:25,360
How many times have I told you?

664
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:26,520
When you play with your blocks,

665
00:31:26,520 --> 00:31:27,840
you leave them everywhere.

666
00:31:27,840 --> 00:31:28,920
What if customers come in?

667
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:31,040
Can't you clean them up?

668
00:31:31,040 --> 00:31:32,520
This kid, seriously.

669
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:49,440
Um...

670
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,840
I... I... I...

671
00:31:50,840 --> 00:31:52,240
I'll practice a bit.

672
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:53,720
I'm gonna go practice.

673
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,880
Practice a bit.

674
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:13,800
Take this big horse.

675
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:14,320
Cut it.

676
00:32:15,120 --> 00:32:15,920
Thank you,

677
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:27,240
Uncle Amin.

678
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,840
Why is your face red?

679
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:31,320
No, no.

680
00:32:31,320 --> 00:32:31,920
It's not.

681
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:36,760
Hurry.

682
00:33:14,120 --> 00:33:15,320
Uncle Amin.

683
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:21,760
Will you come play with me again?

684
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:24,520
I will.

685
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:27,920
That's great!

686
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,280
That's great!

687
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:30,840
Amin.

688
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:34,160
You seem pretty handy with those tools.

689
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:35,360
They're yours.

690
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,360
For me?

691
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:53,680
Thanks.

692
00:33:54,040 --> 00:33:55,320
Thanks.

693
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:01,720
I didn't cook anything,

694
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,320
so I won't ask you to stay.

695
00:34:05,760 --> 00:34:06,040
No.

696
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:06,400
That doesn't matter.

697
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,200
I... I...

698
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,400
I don't eat dinner.

699
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:09,040
No, no.

700
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:10,440
I mean...

701
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:11,520
I eat vegetarian at night.

702
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:15,080
No...

703
00:34:15,080 --> 00:34:15,800
It's getting late.

704
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:16,680
I should go back.

705
00:34:16,680 --> 00:34:17,280
Bye.

706
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:26,720
Let's go.

707
00:34:28,040 --> 00:34:30,440
Yangyang likes Uncle Amin.

708
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:31,720
I like Uncle Amin.

709
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:35,720
Then do you like Sister Yiran

710
00:34:35,720 --> 00:34:37,560
or Uncle Amin?

711
00:34:37,560 --> 00:34:38,800
I like both!

712
00:35:13,680 --> 00:35:14,680
This is the place.

713
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:17,400
Boss, take a look at this plot.

714
00:35:19,080 --> 00:35:20,160
Round on the outside, square inside.

715
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:22,400
An open and spacious front.

716
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:23,520
Mountains in the back.

717
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:24,520
A river in the front.

718
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:26,680
Surrounded by mountains and water.

719
00:35:27,080 --> 00:35:28,720
Right next to the city.

720
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,920
Accessible from all directions.

721
00:35:31,120 --> 00:35:32,120
If buried here,

722
00:35:33,640 --> 00:35:34,680
your dog

723
00:35:34,680 --> 00:35:36,920
will surely be blessed in its next life.

724
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,000
Alright.

725
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,040
I'm buying it.

726
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,720
Xiaofang, sign it.

727
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:45,840
Great-Grandma,

728
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:46,760
please sign.

729
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:06,880
Duoduo loves this blanket the most.

730
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:12,720
He can't even sleep without it.

731
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:29,680
Excuse me,

732
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:31,520
could you use this one?

733
00:36:31,520 --> 00:36:32,920
Duoduo has a lot of fur.

734
00:36:32,920 --> 00:36:33,640
It tangles a lot.

735
00:36:33,640 --> 00:36:36,040
I'm afraid that one will hurt him.

736
00:36:37,120 --> 00:36:38,240
Okay.

737
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:41,960
Thank you.

738
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,160
Why don't you brush him one last time?

739
00:36:50,160 --> 00:36:51,240
It means more when you do it.

740
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:17,600
He loved it most when I rubbed his belly.

741
00:37:17,600 --> 00:37:19,560
Sometimes, if I just waved at him,

742
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:20,560
he'd come right over,

743
00:37:22,560 --> 00:37:24,240
rolling over to show his belly.

744
00:37:26,200 --> 00:37:27,280
Whenever I petted him,

745
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:28,960
he'd wag his tail happily.

746
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:37,000
But I'll never see that again.

747
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,080
Life is but a fleeting moment.

748
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:50,880
Such a brief existence.

749
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:53,640
How can we ever forget?

750
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:56,760
All things have a spirit.

751
00:37:58,120 --> 00:37:58,920
All bonds are guided by fate.

752
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,280
He'll have a peaceful journey.

753
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,920
Thank you.

754
00:38:29,120 --> 00:38:30,600
Duoduo.

755
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:34,160
Rest in peace.

756
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:39,320
Thank you.

757
00:38:39,560 --> 00:38:40,840
My condolences to you too.

758
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:37,560
We're ready.

759
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,160
Honored guests,

760
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,520
family and friends.

761
00:39:48,080 --> 00:39:49,720
Today, we are gathered here

762
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,760
to remember our mutual friend,

763
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:52,240
Duoduo.

764
00:40:07,560 --> 00:40:08,240
Duoduo

765
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:10,000
was not just a pet,

766
00:40:10,240 --> 00:40:11,000
but also family.

767
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,080
Next,

768
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:20,120
let's welcome Duoduo's parent,

769
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:21,920
Ms. Qimeng, to deliver the eulogy.

770
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:26,400
Thank you.

771
00:40:29,720 --> 00:40:30,520
Hello, everyone.

772
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:32,800
I'm Duoduo's mom.

773
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:38,320
Thank you all for taking the time

774
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:40,080
to attend Duoduo's memorial service.

775
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:46,800
Ten years ago,

776
00:40:48,160 --> 00:40:50,080
when Duoduo first came to me,

777
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:51,840
he was so tiny back then,

778
00:40:52,520 --> 00:40:54,360
and so timid.

779
00:41:13,680 --> 00:41:15,680
Thank you for being with me for ten years

780
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:17,240
and for the joy you've brought me.

781
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:19,040
I also hope everyone

782
00:41:19,360 --> 00:41:22,360
will cherish their loved ones.

783
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:28,720
Thank you.

784
00:41:35,240 --> 00:41:38,240
I'm sure Duoduo would want you to be happy.

785
00:41:40,040 --> 00:41:43,520
May Duoduo run on the grass in heaven,

786
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:45,440
happy and free.

787
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:55,840
Please pay your final respects to Duoduo.

788
00:41:59,360 --> 00:42:01,840
Do not stand at my grave and weep.

789
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,640
I am not there.

790
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:07,000
I do not sleep.

791
00:42:09,600 --> 00:42:11,880
I am a thousand winds that blow.

792
00:42:12,240 --> 00:42:15,480
I am the softly falling snow.

793
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:19,640
I am the golden waves of ripened grain.

794
00:42:20,440 --> 00:42:23,240
I am the gentle autumn rain.

795
00:42:24,160 --> 00:42:26,280
I will soar above the river,

796
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:27,520
As a flock of birds taking flight.

797
00:42:27,720 --> 00:42:29,800
When you fall asleep bathed in moonlight,

798
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:33,760
I am the gentle stars in the night sky.

799
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:36,320
Do not stand at my grave and cry.

800
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:37,840
I am not there.

801
00:42:38,400 --> 00:42:40,400
I did not die.

802
00:42:56,840 --> 00:42:59,000
Please observe a moment of silence.

803
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:34,880
Great-Grandma Qimeng,

804
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:38,400
we made something for Duoduo.

805
00:43:50,320 --> 00:43:53,640
This is some fur we clipped from Duoduo.

806
00:43:55,280 --> 00:43:57,560
Keep it as a memento.

807
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:10,440
Thank you.

808
00:44:12,680 --> 00:44:14,680
Thank you for sending him off with care.

809
00:44:16,200 --> 00:44:17,880
His journey won't be lonely.

810
00:44:22,520 --> 00:44:24,400
I'm sorry.

811
00:44:32,000 --> 00:44:33,800
Tears are a privilege of the living.

812
00:44:35,200 --> 00:44:37,000
Tears can't reach him on the other side,

813
00:44:37,600 --> 00:44:38,960
but he can feel the echoes.

814
00:44:41,400 --> 00:44:42,800
Everything you did for him,

815
00:44:43,080 --> 00:44:44,080
your love for him,

816
00:44:44,520 --> 00:44:45,640
he will know it all.

817
00:44:49,720 --> 00:44:50,880
Thank you.

818
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:55,600
Thank you.

819
00:45:06,200 --> 00:45:07,040
Cousin Great-Grandaunt,

820
00:45:07,640 --> 00:45:09,000
Actually,

821
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:12,040
when we tallied up the funeral costs,

822
00:45:12,040 --> 00:45:13,280
it really didn't cost that much.

823
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:15,800
Please take the rest of this money back.

824
00:45:17,240 --> 00:45:18,080
You keep it.

825
00:45:18,760 --> 00:45:20,440
Think of it as a deposit I left here,

826
00:45:20,480 --> 00:45:22,280
a fund for pet funerals.

827
00:45:23,200 --> 00:45:25,040
I trust you'll put it to good use.

828
00:45:27,600 --> 00:45:28,400
We will.

829
00:45:30,120 --> 00:45:30,920
Xiaofang,

830
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:33,400
that brat Zhou Fang...

831
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:35,480
he's so lucky to have you.

832
00:45:43,200 --> 00:45:44,000
Min,

833
00:45:44,480 --> 00:45:46,120
what did you think of the funeral?

834
00:45:47,280 --> 00:45:48,400
Duoduo's funeral...

835
00:45:48,400 --> 00:45:49,200
How did we do?

836
00:45:49,640 --> 00:45:51,600
Every life, no matter how small,

837
00:45:52,080 --> 00:45:53,800
has its meaning and value.

838
00:45:54,320 --> 00:45:55,600
And deserves a proper farewell.

839
00:45:55,800 --> 00:45:56,840
Baixi,

840
00:45:56,840 --> 00:45:57,600
you did great.

841
00:45:58,160 --> 00:46:00,600
This might be a new start for Xiaoxitian.

842
00:46:11,080 --> 00:46:12,000
I'll head over first.

843
00:46:26,280 --> 00:46:26,920
Dad.

844
00:46:32,800 --> 00:46:33,800
Why are you here?

845
00:46:33,800 --> 00:46:35,080
You didn't even tell us you were coming.

846
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:36,760
What?

847
00:46:37,440 --> 00:46:38,840
Can't I come?

848
00:46:40,240 --> 00:46:42,400
I came to see

849
00:46:43,080 --> 00:46:46,200
if you've ruined Xiaoxitian's reputation.

850
00:46:48,160 --> 00:46:48,840
Well?

851
00:46:49,680 --> 00:46:50,360
Did we?

852
00:46:51,080 --> 00:46:52,200
Not this time.

853
00:46:52,200 --> 00:46:54,600
But that doesn't mean you won't next time.

854
00:47:02,320 --> 00:47:03,240
You've got a hair here.

855
00:47:11,600 --> 00:47:14,080
When your old man was twelve,

856
00:47:14,120 --> 00:47:16,160
I followed your grandpa into this trade.

857
00:47:16,680 --> 00:47:17,840
Now,

858
00:47:17,840 --> 00:47:20,880
the world is changing too fast.

859
00:47:22,480 --> 00:47:23,760
I'm getting old.

860
00:47:23,760 --> 00:47:25,640
I'm no use anymore.

861
00:47:27,400 --> 00:47:28,800
But you've grown up.

862
00:47:34,720 --> 00:47:35,520
Go on.

863
00:47:36,800 --> 00:47:39,200
Go do what you love.

864
00:47:46,120 --> 00:47:47,080
Just go.

865
00:47:51,400 --> 00:47:53,000
Then wait for me a sec.
